      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven-look fabric; exact fiber composition was not available in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> One coordinated unisex button-up shirt for children and adults, ready for vacations, family photos, and sunny days together.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Blue Monstera Citrus combines a white ground, vivid blue monstera leaves, pale blue fronds, orange fruit, and small winged-insect accents.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Short sleeves, pointed collar, and front buttons. The white undershirt and hanger shown are styling only and are not included.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Check the sewn-in care label before washing; exact wash instructions were not available in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 4 Years through Child 14 Years, plus Adult M through Adult 5XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Shirt</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg)</th>\n<th>Height (cm)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm)</th>\n<th>Sleeve (cm)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short (cm)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>12.5-20</td>\n<td>95-110</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>15-25</td>\n<td>110-120</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>20-27.5</td>\n<td>120-130</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25-32.5</td>\n<td>130-138</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>30-35</td>\n<td>138-145</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 12 Years</td>\n<td>11-12</td>\n<td>32.5-40</td>\n<td>145-150</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 14 Years</td>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>35-42.5</td>\n<td>150-155</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>42.5-52.5</td>\n<td>155-165</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>52.5-60</td>\n<td>165-175</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>60-65</td>\n<td>165-178</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>65-72.5</td>\n<td>168-180</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>72.5-82.5</td>\n<td>170-180</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 4XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>82.5-90</td>\n<td>170-182</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 5XL</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>90-100</td>\n<td>170-185</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Blue Monstera Citrus brings a crisp tropical palette to matching family style. Saturated blue leaves, airy pale-blue fronds, orange fruit, and small winged accents keep the white-ground shirt bright and distinctive without changing the easy button-up silhouette.</p>\n\n<p>The supplied chart provides recommended height and body-weight ranges for seven child sizes and seven adult sizes. It does not provide chest, sleeve, hip, waist, or garment-length measurements, so those table cells remain marked with an em dash rather than estimated values.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>One family silhouette:</strong> The same unisex collared button-up style is offered across the child and adult size rows.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tropical blue print:</strong> Vivid monstera leaves and pale fronds stand out against the clean white ground.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Orange accents:</strong> Fruit motifs add warm contrast throughout the blue botanical pattern.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Warm-weather details:</strong> Short sleeves and a button front make the shirt easy to layer or wear on its own.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Single-shirt clarity:</strong> Each selected variant is one shirt; the undershirt, hanger, and accessories are not included.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose one size for each family member and build a bright matching look for the next trip, gathering, or photo day.</p>",
